// 1. Split params: 2D non-embedding → MuonGC; embeddings/biases/norms → AdamW
// 2. for each step:
// 3.   buf ← lerp(buf, g, 1−β),  $\tilde g ← \mathrm{lerp}(g, \mathrm{buf}, \beta)$  (Nesterov)
// 4.   if $\tilde g$ is 2D: $\tilde g ← \tilde g − \mathrm{rowmean}(\tilde g)$  (gradient centralisation)
// 5.   $U ← \mathrm{NewtonSchulz}_5(\tilde g)$  (a,b,c = 3.4445, −4.7750, 2.0315)
// 6.   apply scale $\sqrt{\max(1, m/n)}$ for fan-out, split fused QKV into 3
// 7.   $p ← (1 − \eta\,\mathrm{wd})\,p − \eta\cdot\text{scale}\cdot U$
// 8. AdamW path runs in parallel for wte/wpe/lm_head and 1D params

// 1. Override hp: $\eta = 6\times 10^{-4}$, wd = 0.1, β = (0.9, 0.98)
// 2. Group params: dim ≥ 2 with wd, dim < 2 without wd
// 3. for each step:
// 4.   for each tensor p with grad g:
// 5.     if $\|g\|_2 > 1$: $g ← g \cdot 1/\|g\|_2$  (per-tensor clip)
// 6.     decoupled wd: $p ← (1 − \eta\,\mathrm{wd})\,p$
// 7.     $m ← \beta_1 m + (1−\beta_1)g$,  $v ← \beta_2 v + (1−\beta_2)g^2$
// 8.     $\hat m = m/(1−\beta_1^t)$, $\hat v = v/(1−\beta_2^t)$
// 9.     $p ← p − \eta\,\hat m / (\sqrt{\hat v}+\varepsilon)$
// 10. CONFIG_OVERRIDES: warmup_iters=400, min_lr=4e-5

// 1. Split params: 2D non-embedding → 'trust' group; rest → 'adam' group
// 2. for each step, for each p:
// 3.   $m ← \beta_1 m + (1−\beta_1)g$, $v ← \beta_2 v + (1−\beta_2)g^2$  (β=(0.9, 0.96))
// 4.   $u = \hat m / (\sqrt{\hat v}+\varepsilon)$ with bias correction
// 5.   decoupled wd: $p ← (1 − \eta\,\mathrm{wd})\,p$
// 6.   if mode = 'trust':
// 7.     $\rho = \mathrm{clip}(\|p\| / \|u\|, 0.5, 2.0)$  (trust ratio)
// 8.     $r_t = 0.95\,r_{t-1} + 0.05\,\mathrm{rms}(g)$,  gate = clip($r_t/\mathrm{rms}(g)$, 0.8, 1.2)
// 9.     scale = $\rho \cdot$ gate; else scale = 1
// 10.  $p ← p − \eta \cdot \text{scale} \cdot u$

